   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it interrupts the narrative at its most tense moment?$q$, $q$[{"text":"sentence 11","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-action"},{"text":"sentence 9","is_correct":true},{"text":"sentence 8","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-time-pressure"},{"text":"sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-turning-point"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sentence 9$q$, $q$Sentence 9 is background about the school that stalls the action just as the narrator must fix the jam. Sentence 8 must stay because the chorus already underway is what makes the moment urgent.$q$, 'draft', 'b6d6c2f9-3e24-5625-927f-10feea480caf')
